Render an off-axis cinematic camera from a recorded GX scene.

Reuses upstream GX replay and a separate software rasterizer. The host chooses
when to use it and the target aspect. The original scene is restored after rendering.
Keeps screen-space 3D UI across alternating scenes and composes text/palette OBJ
from both 2D engines, excluding captured bitmap copies of the old 3D view.
The optional compositor tap is owned through NDS userdata, without global state.

